  "description": "About: Pastel Gingham Seamless Pattern Bundle, Colorful Checkered Plaid Digital Paper Pack, Blue Yellow Green Orange Repeating Backgrounds, Cute Picnic-Inspired Seamless Patterns\n♥ Perfect for fabric printing, stationery, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, invitations, POD products, and more.\nYou Will Receive\n10 x JPEG files\n(300 DPI, 12×12 inches)\n1x EPS files (fully editable)\nUses: These seamless gingham and plaid patterns are perfect for:\nFabric & textile design\nWrapping paper\nScrapbooking\nInvitations & stationery\nPackaging design\nPrint-on-demand products\nNursery & kids products\nHome decor projects\nDigital backgrounds\nNotes\n* Note — Unzip the files before use.\nColors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and print settings.\nA computer and compatible design software are required to open and edit the files.\nThis pastel gingham seamless pattern bundle features a collection of colorful checkered, plaid, and striped designs inspired by classic picnic aesthetics. The set includes blue, yellow, green, orange, and sky-blue color variations, making it ideal for spring and summer projects. These seamless repeating patterns are perfect for fabric printing, packaging, stationery, digital papers, and print-on-demand products. The timeless gingham style works beautifully for both modern and vintage-inspired designs.\nIf you need any adjustments or have questions, feel free to contact me.\nThank you so much 💙",
  "fullDescription": "<p>About: Pastel Gingham Seamless Pattern Bundle, Colorful Checkered Plaid Digital Paper Pack, Blue Yellow Green Orange Repeating Backgrounds, Cute Picnic-Inspired Seamless Patterns</p>\n<p>♥ Perfect for fabric printing, stationery, scrapbooking, wrapping paper, packaging, invitations, POD products, and more.</p>\n<p>You Will Receive<br>\n10 x JPEG files<br>\n(300 DPI, 12×12 inches)<br>\n1x EPS files (fully editable)</p>\n<p>Uses: These seamless gingham and plaid patterns are perfect for:</p>\n<p>Fabric &amp; textile design<br>\nWrapping paper<br>\nScrapbooking<br>\nInvitations &amp; stationery<br>\nPackaging design<br>\nPrint-on-demand products<br>\nNursery &amp; kids products<br>\nHome decor projects<br>\nDigital backgrounds<br>\nNotes</p>\n<p>* Note — Unzip the files before use.</p>\n<p>Colors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and print settings.<br>\nA computer and compatible design software are required to open and edit the files.</p>\n<p>This pastel gingham seamless pattern bundle features a collection of colorful checkered, plaid, and striped designs inspired by classic picnic aesthetics. The set includes blue, yellow, green, orange, and sky-blue color variations, making it ideal for spring and summer projects. These seamless repeating patterns are perfect for fabric printing, packaging, stationery, digital papers, and print-on-demand products. The timeless gingham style works beautifully for both modern and vintage-inspired designs.</p>\n<p>If you need any adjustments or have questions, feel free to contact me.<br>\nThank you so much 💙</p>",
